---
// Banda de 3 "figuras" com ilustração line-art e rótulo mono (FIG 0.2 da Linear).
---

<section class="figs">
  <div class="container figs-grid" data-stagger>
    <div class="fig">
      <span class="mono-index">Controle</span>
      <div class="fig-art">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 220 170" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- camadas empilhadas -->
          <polygon class="lit" points="110,18 178,52 110,86 42,52" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="var(--brand-tint)" fill-opacity="0.5"/>
          <polygon points="110,44 178,78 110,112 42,78" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="110,64 178,98 110,132 42,98" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="110,84 178,118 110,152 42,118" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <line x1="42" y1="52" x2="42" y2="118" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
          <line x1="178" y1="52" x2="178" y2="118" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
          <line x1="110" y1="86" x2="110" y2="152" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="fig-title">Feita para controle</p>
      <p>Camadas de contas, aprovações e indicadores consolidadas em uma única visão operacional.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fig">
      <span class="mono-index">Governança</span>
      <div class="fig-art">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 220 170" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- blocos conectados -->
          <polygon points="76,30 118,51 76,72 34,51" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="34,51 76,72 76,118 34,97" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="118,51 76,72 76,118 118,97" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="158,58 192,75 158,92 124,75" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="124,75 158,92 158,126 124,109" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="192,75 158,92 158,126 192,109" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon class="lit" points="120,104 148,118 120,132 92,118" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="var(--brand-tint)" fill-opacity="0.6"/>
          <line class="dash" x1="96" y1="82" x2="126" y2="94" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
          <line class="dash" x1="150" y1="100" x2="134" y2="110" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="fig-title">Automação com governança</p>
      <p>Fluxos conectados por regras e alçadas — cada etapa registrada, nada fora do processo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fig">
      <span class="mono-index">Precisão</span>
      <div class="fig-art">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 220 170" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- planos em sequência -->
          <polygon points="58,36 88,21 88,121 58,136" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="88,42 112,30 112,118 88,130" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="112,48 132,38 132,114 112,124" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon class="lit" points="132,54 148,46 148,110 132,118" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="var(--brand-tint)" fill-opacity="0.5"/>
          <polygon points="148,58 161,52 161,107 148,113" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <polygon points="161,62 172,57 172,104 161,109" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
          <line x1="40" y1="148" x2="185" y2="96" stroke="var(--border-strong)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="fig-title">Desenhada para precisão</p>
      <p>Menos ruído, mais rastreabilidade: números confiáveis para decisões que não admitem erro.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .figs {
    padding: var(--space-96) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }
  .figs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
  .fig {
    padding: var(--space-24) var(--space-40);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .fig:first-child {
    border-left: none;
  }
  .fig-art {
    margin: var(--space-24) 0 var(--space-32);
  }
  .fig-art svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 260px;
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .fig-art .lit {
      animation: figGlow 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-box: fill-box;
      transform-origin: center;
    }
    .fig:nth-child(2) .lit { animation-delay: 0.9s; }
    .fig:nth-child(3) .lit { animation-delay: 1.8s; }
    .fig-art .dash {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      animation: dashFlow 1.2s linear infinite;
    }
  }
  @keyframes figGlow {
    0%, 100% {
      fill-opacity: 0.28;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 rgba(112, 108, 176, 0));
    }
    50% {
      fill-opacity: 0.85;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(112, 108, 176, 0.55));
    }
  }
  @keyframes dashFlow {
    to { stroke-dashoffset: -14; }
  }
  .fig .fig-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 0;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .fig p {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 300px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .figs-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-48);
    }
    .fig {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
      padding: var(--space-32) 0 0;
    }
    .fig:first-child {
      border-top: none;
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
